{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1456750-essence-the-great-curse-and-exigents","id":1456750,"title":"Essence: The Great Curse and Exigents?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Exigents"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-08-13T05:45:09-07:00","id":1456750,"title":"Essence: The Great Curse and Exigents?","content":"So I made my own Exigent character for an Essence game but realised that there seems to be no Great Curse for Janest or guidelines for our own characters.<br /> Am I missing something? Is that intentional?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/535-bastet","name":"Bastet","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"337"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-19T12:03:39-08:00","id":1500754,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Bastet</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1456750-essence-the-great-curse-and-exigents#post1456750\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I made my own Exigent character for an Essence game but realised that there seems to be no Great Curse for Janest or guidelines for our own characters.<br /> Am I missing something? Is that intentional?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Would have to give a serious dive into the books to confirm, but i vaguely remember people in the past discussing the Exigents not suffering from the Curse, so (if correct on my part) that would be intentional indeed i guess.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1147-baaldam","name":"Baaldam","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1147_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4937"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-19T16:30:59-08:00","id":1500782,"title":"","content":"It's an error. The Exigents manuscript confirms that Exigents suffer from the Great Curse, although the manner varies from Exigent to Exigent, but they all suffer from it. For Janest, I\u2019d add \u201csee outsiders harm her community\u201d to her list of triggers, and base her Limit Breaks on compassion for her community, animosity for outsiders, and stubbornness. Her two sample Limit Breaks are: Hero-Surpassing Hubris, spend a scene attempting an impossible task; and Trouble-Uprooting Approach, spend a session ignoring anything that prevents you from taking the most expeditious approach to your goals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1424-ghanjrho","name":"GhanjRho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1424_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"126"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-21T16:06:29-08:00","id":1500966,"title":"","content":"See, I think Exalted Essence might actually present Exigents a bit differently. I've not read that text myself, but I do recall the developer Neall expressing an idea that Exalted other than those who existed during the Divine Rebellion wouldn't have the Curse, both as a matter of what seemed logical and in the interests of simplicity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-01-22T21:55:18-08:00","id":1501107,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>GhanjRho</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/exigents/1456750-essence-the-great-curse-and-exigents?p=1500782#post1500782\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's an error. The Exigents manuscript confirms that Exigents suffer from the Great Curse, although the manner varies from Exigent to Exigent, but they all suffer from it. For Janest, I\u2019d add \u201csee outsiders harm her community\u201d to her list of triggers, and base her Limit Breaks on compassion for her community, animosity for outsiders, and stubbornness. Her two sample Limit Breaks are: Hero-Surpassing Hubris, spend a scene attempting an impossible task; and Trouble-Uprooting Approach, spend a session ignoring anything that prevents you from taking the most expeditious approach to your goals.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is correct. There will both be a brief section on making your own for your Exigent and specific versions for Janest in the print version.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26472-snoutopus","name":"Snoutopus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26472_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}